<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<Defs>

	<ThingDef ParentName="CGF1_MWP_Pistol_Compact_T1">
		<defName>CGF1_MWP_Type64_Pistol_</defName>
		<label>Type 64 Pistol</label>
		<description>Caliber: 7.62x17mm Rimless. 7-round detachable mag. Semi-Automatic.
	
The Type 64 (not to be confused with the Type 64 Silenced) is a Chinese compact pistol developed in the 1960s, developed as a successor to the earlier Type 52. The Type 64 shoots a unique 7.62x17mm Rimless round, very similar but not interchangeable with the .32 ACP - the round and the weapon were specially designed to be used in very close quarters situations where overpenetration was a massive risk, chiefly, aboard airplanes. Consequently, pistols like the Type 64 proved pretty popular with Chinese special police units, and some may remain in service to the present day.</description>
		<graphicData>
			<texPath>CGF1/Gun/Type64_Pistol</texPath>
			<drawSize>0.90</drawSize>
		</graphicData>
		<uiIconScale>1.4</uiIconScale>
		<recipeMaker>
			<recipeUsers>
				<li>CGF1_MWP_Building_Gunsmith</li>
			</recipeUsers>
			<researchPrerequisite>CGF1_MWP_Research_T8_AtomicAgeFirearms</researchPrerequisite>
			<skillRequirements>
				<Crafting>4</Crafting>
			</skillRequirements>
		</recipeMaker>
		<costList>
			<Steel>20</Steel>
			<ComponentIndustrial>2</ComponentIndustrial>
		</costList>
		<statBases>
			<WorkToMake>5000</WorkToMake>
			<Mass>0.9</Mass>
			<AccuracyTouch>0.85</AccuracyTouch>
			<AccuracyShort>0.65</AccuracyShort>
			<AccuracyMedium>0.35</AccuracyMedium>
			<AccuracyLong>0.30</AccuracyLong>
			<RangedWeapon_Cooldown>1</RangedWeapon_Cooldown>
		</statBases>
		<weaponTags>
			<li>CGF1_Pistol_Civilian</li>
			<li>CGF1_Pistol_Military</li>
		</weaponTags>
		<weaponClasses>
			<li>RangedLight</li>
		</weaponClasses>
		<tradeTags>
			<li>CGF1_GunsGalore_ColdWarChinaVietnam</li>
			<li>CGF1_GunsGalore_ColdWarChinaVietnam_Pistol</li>
		</tradeTags>
		<verbs>
			<li>
				<verbClass>Verb_Shoot</verbClass>
				<hasStandardCommand>true</hasStandardCommand>
				<defaultProjectile>CGF1_MWP_Bullet_762x17mmRimless_Pistol</defaultProjectile>
				<warmupTime>0.15</warmupTime>
				<range>25.9</range>
				<soundCast>CGF1_GG_SFXR_Pistol4</soundCast>
				<soundCastTail>GunTail_Light</soundCastTail>
				<muzzleFlashScale>9</muzzleFlashScale>
			</li>
		</verbs>
		<tools>
			<li>
				<label>grip</label>
				<capacities>
					<li>Blunt</li>
				</capacities>
				<power>9</power>
				<cooldownTime>2</cooldownTime>
			</li>
			<li>
				<label>barrel</label>
				<capacities>
					<li>Blunt</li>
					<li>Poke</li>
				</capacities>
				<power>9</power>
				<cooldownTime>2</cooldownTime>
			</li>
		</tools>
		<modExtensions>
			<li Class="MuzzleFlash.MuzzleFlashProps" MayRequire="issaczhuang.muzzleflash">
				<def>MF_StandardMuzzleFalshTwo</def>
				<drawSize>(0.8,0.8)</drawSize>
				<offsets>
					<li>(0.20,0.15)</li>
				</offsets>
			</li>
		</modExtensions>
		<generateCommonality>0.10</generateCommonality> <!-- Average -->
	</ThingDef>
	
